  "_comment": "Vietnamese ICD-10 reference dictionary. `name_vi` is the LOOKUP SURFACE and, via ICD10Linker -> get_canonical_name(rec['name_vi']), it also determines the NODE NAME in Neo4j. Those are two different jobs with two different authorities (principle 6: node name <- corpus, code <- authoritative standard), so the precise standard term lives in `name_vi_full`, not in `name_vi`. Changing `name_vi` renames graph nodes -- see data/exports/node_naming_provenance.csv before touching it.",
  "_rules": "BAT BUOC ke tu 2026-07-27: moi record duoc THEM MOI hoac SUA MA/TEN phai co truong `standard_source` dan nguon co tham quyen (vd 'WHO ICD-10 2019 (K25); BYT QD 7603/QD-BYT ban Viet ngu'). Ly do: 27/49 ma RxCUI trong rxnorm_vi.json tung sai vi khong record nao ghi nguon, nen khong ai kiem chung duoc va khong ai phat hien duoc. Ma khong dan duoc nguon thi khong duoc ghi vao day. KHONG bat buoc backfill 53 record cu ngay -- ap dung cho moi thay doi tu nay tro di. Tieu chi nhan mot chuoi vao `synonyms` (4 tieu chi da duyet, xem cung bo quy tac trong src/entity_linking/canonical_synonyms_vi.json): (1) khong thu hep mot NHOM ve mot THANH VIEN; (2) khong nang mot TRIEU CHUNG len thanh CHAN DOAN; (3) khong cam ket qua muc vao mot chan doan cap tinh; (4) khong them chuoi ma ALIAS_MAP/ICD10Linker da xu ly.",
